P1/S12/0001 — Shared test + CI consolidation — artifact log
ADR-010 (repo reorganization / clean-architecture finishing pass). Delegation FORBIDDEN.

Goal: a green, enforced CI lane for the shared KMP core — all unit + golden-vector
tests, the OpenAPI contract drift gate, and a Kover coverage floor on the critical
packages (net/auth/cache/units/presentation) — path-filtered on every PR touching
apps/shared/** or api/openapi/**, with Gradle cached.

=== CHANGES ===
- apps/shared/gradle/libs.versions.toml
    + kover = "0.9.8"   (versions)
    + kover plugin id  = "org.jetbrains.kotlinx.kover"   (plugins)
- apps/shared/build.gradle.kts
    + alias(libs.plugins.kover) apply false   (root resolves the plugin)
- apps/shared/core/build.gradle.kts
    + alias(libs.plugins.kover)               (applied in the only code module)
    + kover { reports { ... } } block:
        * report scope = critical packages only
          (net/auth/cache/units/presentation); generated DTOs/endpoints
          (api.generated.*) and the generated SQLDelight db (cache.db.*) excluded.
        * total.log onCheck=true — prints total critical-package line coverage.
        * verify rules:
            - aggregate line coverage >= 80%  (actual 86.86%)
            - per-package line coverage >= 55% (lowest actual 61.0% — presentation/telemetry)
- .github/workflows/apps-shared.yml
    Replaced the P0/0004 no-op guard with the real lane:
        * path filters: apps/shared/**, api/openapi/**, apps/tools/codegen/**, the workflow.
        * actions/setup-java temurin 21 with `cache: gradle`.
        * gradlew :core:allTests :core:koverVerify :core:koverLog  (suites + coverage floor).
        * upload-artifact: kover report.xml + html.
        * OpenAPI contract drift gate: apps/tools/codegen/gen-clients.ps1 -Check.
        * OpenAPI runtime shape check: probes vars.APPS_SHARED_CONFORMANCE_API_URL;
          documents RUNTIME_SHAPE=BLOCKED with reason when no backend is reachable
          (not skipped silently).

Golden vectors: aggregated and asserted by KMP commonTest. Units S5 vectors load
from apps/shared/spec/units-golden.json (deterministic, language-neutral); S8
derivation vectors load from apps/shared/core/spec/*-golden.json. The C# side
asserts the same vectors in P2/W5 (out of scope here).

